{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1533701-mystery-cult-initiation-sanctity-of-merits-and-verosimilitude","id":1533701,"title":"Mystery Cult Initiation, Sanctity of Merits and verosimilitude","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-04-06T08:51:35-07:00","id":1533701,"title":"Mystery Cult Initiation, Sanctity of Merits and verosimilitude","content":"Greetings,<br /> <br /> I got a set of questions about how Mystery Cult Initiation works. Essentially, if I imagine a cult with the following benefits per Rank:<br /> <br /> \u2022 Academics Specialty (Linguistics)<br /> \u2022\u2022 Area of Expertise (Linguistics)<br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022 Resources 2<br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 Multilingual x3<br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 Resources 2 and Language merit<ol class=\"decimal\"><li>I am at the highest level, but I lose standing in the cult and get to zero, do I just forget all the languages and skills? Are the benefits purely magical and they are gone, or what happens to the characters<b> in-game</b>? Sudden memory loss?</li> <li>How many people do you need to establish a cult and get the benefits? <b>Mechanically</b>, can I just create my own cult and take the benefits without any other co-religionist?</li> <li>What happens when the cult members die and you are the last one standing, the cult is dissolved and you lose benefits?</li> <li>Can you improve a merit given by the Mystery Cult Initiation? In the example, at the third level you get Resources 2, can you buy the 3rd, 4th and 5th dot? Or if you have already do they stack?</li> <li>Do merits dots stack with themselves? In the example, they get Resources 2 twice at different levels; can they use Resources 4, or just double the usage of Resources 2?</li> </ol><br /> <br /> I might ask this on some gamelines Ask a Simple Answer too.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-06T09:52:50-07:00","id":1533705,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lbeaumanior</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1533701-mystery-cult-initiation-sanctity-of-merits-and-verosimilitude#post1533701\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I am at the highest level, but I lose standing in the cult and get to zero, do I just forget all the languages and skills? Are the benefits purely magical and they are gone, or what happens to the characters<b> in-game</b>? Sudden memory loss?</div> </div> </div> </div>Frankly, this is in &quot;figure it out yourself&quot; territory, because Mystery Cult Initiation doubling as Status doesn't mean it operates the same as Status \u2014 it's Mystery Cult <i>Initiation</i>, meaning the magic tricks and such are acquired as part of reaching that level of involvement in the cult.<br /> <br /> Geist's iteration of the mechanics includes notes in the Krewe Binding Ceremony on what happens when a celebrant's membership is revoked, and that's &quot;they keep their Mystery Cult Initiation dots, but lose access to any benefits that rely on the krewe's shared resources and goodwill, and they can redesign any lost dots under the auspices of Sanctity of Merits.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> How many people do you need to establish a cult and get the benefits? </div> </div> </div>To taste, though by implication and for practicality's sake most Mystery Cults are going to be an appreciable fraction to a single-digit multiple of the size of the student headcount in an average school classroom.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <b>Mechanically</b>, can I just create my own cult and take the benefits without any other co-religionist? </div> </div> </div>One person is not a cult. You could be the only remaining member of a cult and presumably hang onto whatever benefits would make sense to remain, but by definition you're not getting to that point without a Purpose, Relic, and Doctrine, and if you're just some guy what you have is a collection of personal beliefs, not a set of traditions.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What happens when the cult members die and you are the last one standing, the cult is dissolved and you lose benefits? </div> </div> </div>You can recruit if you want, but any benefits that relied on belonging to a group of people or maintaining stuff that required upkeep you couldn't provide on your own are going to be unusable until those conditions are met again.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Can you improve a merit given by the Mystery Cult Initiation? In the example, at the third level you get Resources 2, can you buy the 3rd, 4th and 5th dot? Or if you have already do they stack? </div> </div> </div>As appropriate for the Merit. Resources doesn't represent separate instances of wealth, but whether a Retainer would be suitable would depend on what it represents \u2014 if your cult-granted Retainer is a consistent character capable of meaningful growth? Sure, but if it instead represents a summoned creature or the ability to call upon a dedicated category of follower or something else it's probably not going higher, to say nothing of how it almost definitely wouldn't make your existing unrelated Retainer more effective.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do merits dots stack with themselves? In the example, they get Resources 2 twice at different levels; can they use Resources 4, or just double the usage of Resources 2? </div> </div> </div>If your mystical secret society's supernatural benefits are &quot;the mid-level guys have a comfortable amount of spare cash and the founder is filthy rich,&quot; I would have to question the design motives behind such a decision.<br /> <br /> That said, you can definitely use Merits provided at an earlier rank to meet the prerequisites for later ones, and if your time worshiping a weird floating orb has given you minor telekinetic talents it makes sense for deeper investment to intensify those powers.<br /> <br /> A lot of this is largely resolved by Geist and Mummy using Mystery/Scorpion Cult Initiation to represent Things Different Degrees Of Cultist Can Do and offloading temporal benefits to the space of Krewe/Cult Merits.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-06T18:20:48-07:00","id":1533728,"title":"","content":"Thanks for the answer <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar111_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"111\" data-vbnamecard=\"111\">Satchel</a> , regarding<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1533701-mystery-cult-initiation-sanctity-of-merits-and-verosimilitude?p=1533705#post1533705\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If your mystical secret society's supernatural benefits are &quot;the mid-level guys have a comfortable amount of spare cash and the founder is filthy rich,&quot; I would have to question the design motives behind such a decision.</div> </div> </div> </div>Resources 2 is the only example that came to mind that could either be used as double the usage of the merit, or make the merit stack with itself for the higher version. All of the example benefits are used for the sake of the example.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}